Id: krb001w
Severity: WARN
Category: accounts
Check: check_kerberos
References: krb5.conf(5)

Kerberos permits single-DES encryption, by an enctype or by
allow_weak_crypto. Its 56-bit keys fall to brute force, so whoever
captures a ticket, or the keytab below, reads it offline. Take the
single-DES enctypes out of [libdefaults] and re-key what
authenticated under them.
